After Pay Me, the chaotic Monk had killed the priest of Chih Sung-tzu
he donated all ~90.000 zorkmids to a priest of Shan Lai Ching, who refused
to aid him any further.

This angered Pay Me and he did not delay any further and went to kill
the leader of the heathens, Master Kaen. On the way there Huan Ti led
him onto a strange place and Pay Me felt a change coming over him. He
felt like a new man. This got him 2 levels of experience but cost him
one point of constitution (the transformation was taxing even to somebody
of Pay Me's awesome powers).

Pay Me exchanged his Robe for a cloak of Magic Resistance, waited a few
turns for the oppertune moment and entered the presence of Master Kaen.

The place was dark and so Pay Me cast a spell of light on it.

Master Kaen, sensing a worthy opponent had arrived, cowered in fear and
summoned insects, before jumping at Pay Me. Pay Me however had anticipated
this and evaded the first attack of Master Kaen.

Pay Me's keen eyes examined Master Kaen and judged him at 100 HP and AC -14.
A sharp jab at Master Kaen's throat and a punch in the stomach followed.

Some Earth Elementals and Xorns danced around the two fighters but were
unable to hit Pay Me, so great was his Kung Fu.

Master Kaen retaliated with a blow to Pay Me's head and cast a spell at
Pay Me, causing his body to be covered with painful wounds.

Master Kaen taunted Pay Me, saying "Despair now, Student of Waters. Huan Ti
cannot help you." Pay Me was undaunted. Huan Ti had granted him protection,
yet this fight was Pay Me's alone, and he knew it.

A quick exchange of blows followed during which Master Kaen again caused
severe wounds to appear on Pay Me. Pay Me now judged Master Kaen to be at
42 HP and hit him hard again.

Master Kaen summoned the last of his power and landed some heavy hits on
Pay Me again causing painful wounds on his body. Pay Me however proved the
stronger and hit a vital point on Master Kaen who dropped dead instantly.

And thus Master Kaen found his end at the fists of Pay Me, most powerful
leader of the White Lotus. 

Pay Me took the Eyes of the Overworld and went his way, with about 180 HP
of 255 left.
